  "body": "This may solely be a documentation omission, at any rate the `/events` endpoint only specifies the presence of a `from` token string which can be retrieved from [room initial sync](https://matrix.org/docs/spec/client_server/r0.2.0.html#get-matrix-client-r0-rooms-roomid-initialsync)\r\n```\r\nfrom \tstring \tThe token to stream from. This token is either from a previous request to this API or from the initial sync API.\r\n```\r\nAlso (undocumented) but `limit, dir, to` are parsed as well by the PaginationConfig object. Nevertheless there does not appear to be a way to obtain a `from` token at the start of the historical timeline since the room initial sync is limited to returning recent events (https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/synapse/handlers/initial_sync.py#L396). ",
